# Co-op impassable-terrain ground marker: a flat tinted plane a little wider than its rock cell
# (13 m vs the 10 m block), lying just above the ground so a dark red rim shows around every rock
# — the "no building, no walking" zone reads at a glance, and with the rock tops varying the rim
# is what outlines the blocked footprint exactly. Render only, spawned one per blocked cell next
# to rock.pre under the CoopTerrain root.
Prefab gameTerrainMark
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Plane
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.5 0.12 0.1
		Position 0 0.04 0
		Scale 6.5
